{
  "id": "sjWorkflowE00001",
  "name": "E · Newsletter campaigns",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "2b8e348c-e107-4b66-87e4-844428082bde",
      "name": "Note bbnu4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -420,
        -460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## E · Newsletter campaigns\n**Create a campaign** in Supabase (table `newsletter_campaigns`: identifier, subject, html_body, text_body, optional segment like `{\"tags_any\":[\"founders\"]}`).\n\n**Send it** either:\n1. From Supabase SQL editor: `select public.request_campaign_send('identifier');` (arrives via the Webhook), or\n2. Here: edit **Manual campaign settings**, then *Execute workflow*.\n\nOnly **active** (confirmed) subscribers are selected; pending, unsubscribed, bounced and suppressed contacts are never included, and each recipient is re-checked right before sending. Re-running resumes without sending anyone the same campaign twice.\n\nEvery email gets a personal unsubscribe link and per-recipient delivery status (`campaign_recipients`). The Wait node throttles batches: check your Hostinger plan's sending limits before large sends.",
        "width": 700,
        "height": 380
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2219f53f-2ff9-4895-b83e-dcd03c9ed86a",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -400,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "de45d727-5e25-4b8e-a43b-c54f27b6308f",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "sj-campaign",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "sjWebhookAuth001",
          "name": "Website → n8n (X-Webhook-Secret)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6eeaa625-b833-4a04-aca6-2643ecd46e35",
      "name": "Claim event (idempotency)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -180,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000,
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $json.body.callback_url }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ action: 'event.claim', event_id: $json.body.event_id }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 20000
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "sjCallbackAuth01",
          "name": "n8n → Supabase (X-Automation-Secret)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "173e3194-a796-4326-8e91-fd2d30200232",
      "name": "Manual trigger",
